{"posts":[{"id":"whenever_p7_151","t":"thanks for giving me your point of view. It 'always very appreciated.","a":"full","d":"","n":"#151","p":7,"im":[],"m":151},{"id":"whenever_p7_152","t":"Hi Guys,\n\nscalping here and there from time to time, when possible. Saw this CP Up, after that the previous Low was taken out... I know most of us just post the nicest ones.... but let me enjoy this Baby! It could even go further down, we will see. Have a nice week end.","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#152","p":7,"im":["d26559d666124316ecdf05b8494b7763003e6636","5509247ff62f6e49a46e801d4242f3e219afdce1"],"m":152},{"id":"whenever_p7_153","t":"Yeah mate, yellow circle is very important moment","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#153","p":7,"im":[],"m":153},{"id":"whenever_p7_154","t":"...training patience...\n\n...be patient......be patient......be patient...\n\nHappy Trading to All","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#154","p":7,"im":["55194d3e8e2f990ffcd28286a4eb805b2385570a"],"m":154},{"id":"whenever_p7_155","t":"sorry, forgot to mention the reason of my 1st entry. It goes back to August last year. (see the red lines as a reference)","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#155","p":7,"im":["bc7222a6437412ce429ba1fa3b8e3123f7145d5d","b42b55c1a88da19835c847a4744a023969339bec"],"m":155},{"id":"whenever_p7_156","t":"Hi mate I'm glad you're back","a":"full","d":"","n":"#156","p":7,"im":[],"m":156},{"id":"whenever_p7_157","t":"Well done, you're a sniper!","a":"Al3cs","d":"","n":"#157","p":7,"im":[],"m":157},{"id":"whenever_p7_158","t":"Whenever wrote: sorry, forgot to mention the reason of my 1st entry. It goes back to August last year. (see the red lines as a reference)\n\n..nice catch Whenever, really nice! you took it as Cap on Price or smtng else? one question if you don't mind: your scalp at post 152: your entry was at the highest supply, there was a lower one but why you decided that it wasn't the reversal? thank you, all the best","a":"althoufx","d":"","n":"#158","p":7,"im":["bc7222a6437412ce429ba1fa3b8e3123f7145d5d","b42b55c1a88da19835c847a4744a023969339bec"],"m":158},{"id":"whenever_p7_159","t":"No Need to be Greedy, no need at all. Build up your plan, not only about reading, but also about managing your trade. Step by step.\n\n...especially when you know that there is a very probable FO above","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#159","p":7,"im":["7feced35dce1c676be25a825b67ca3bfcedca3fe","3745aad33ed2ca02091604f1f6292c18536f8c91"],"m":159},{"id":"whenever_p7_160","t":"You know, I just love that! It's one of my favourite things to see!\n\nYou knew there'd be a bounce, with a chance of giving very high R, but a chance of turning at the first hurdle, so you took enough out at the FTA to make sure a winner would always be a winner!\n\nIt's perfect. It's beautiful","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#160","p":7,"im":[],"m":160},{"id":"whenever_p7_161","t":"Ifmyante wrote: You know, I just love that! It's one of my favourite things to see!\n\nYou knew there'd be a bounce, with a chance of giving very high R, but a chance of turning at the first hurdle, so you took enough out at the FTA to make sure a winner would always be a winner!\n\nIt's perfect. It's beautiful\n\nThanks IF, yes, it is just \"enough\", and yes, it is really beatiful. I learned that from seeing way too many great trades get back to BE after being in nice profit. Home Runs may happen, of course, but games are won with one base after the other.\n\nBTW I missed this beauty here below... well, so what? Next. Always nice to see that: look at the first supply move and approach back to the level.\n\nand look what's going on on HTF...\n\nI seriously think that just with this set up, at the right place and with a healty Trade & Money Management we can work very nicely.","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#161","p":7,"im":["1318baa54edf2470c53a7c797d8b8fa8929b4595","58efd3b9c4a161f49a784d4f71db6674eb3c364c"],"m":161},{"id":"whenever_p7_162","t":"...the real BINGO was actually here up... But I wasn't ready in that moment.\n\nBut if you patiently wait, you may have a second chance later.","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#162","p":7,"im":["785fea8dbf2f63a74edb3e49650cfb54e3854aa1","64c948fb85fc572fe8a69cd924cdc855cbf333a2"],"m":162},{"id":"whenever_p7_163","t":"Pending order left there a while ago. Everything may happen of course, we will lose some trades sometimes, no other way. But odds are really in our favour if we are not greedy.\n\nReason why:\n\nand a more detailed reason why:","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#163","p":7,"im":["4c9b87b9c2132b706db5e7d3e48c96330169faa9","f4f53812762dfe94b0af8b8751d7cb30c1601d65","a60d0f363cabaf26d688fc3910adb849c008d10f"],"m":163},{"id":"whenever_p7_164","t":"nothing nicer than a stroooong bullish news driven move after a short engulf of a DP...\n\n...edit... update","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#164","p":7,"im":["623af5cdb9824833f3fd6ec9c0b3c1bf8f1d42a8","4a46fb52a3dd0da07c8fdbd7a5904bd6b966e4da"],"m":164},{"id":"whenever_p7_165","t":"and GN and GU...more or less the same idea...","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#165","p":7,"im":["97f3ea150d5a0567fbaf011468453f2ba12e4c99","9f99b29af9e9d191491a6fe14590267dfd77c80e"],"m":165},{"id":"whenever_p7_166","t":"you killed the market","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#166","p":7,"im":[],"m":166},{"id":"whenever_p7_167","t":"...it is all about detecting the right lines....","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#167","p":7,"im":["5bf9658e6344098bfa7eade83e1b7a462e436aa4","44618984155e3541d1f7aa285a8a2a3330805857","482a415c338d08581632fb3aeac8a9053daec1c6","af7a1dbe1a5ced2bb98d958797d7e4920632de74"],"m":167},{"id":"whenever_p7_168","t":"and again","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#168","p":7,"im":["f447f61ede272518ffc3d894a14a68a1303a2ac5","cb909d9b32c703e2a05e9517bd90498f2459557e"],"m":168},{"id":"whenever_p7_169","t":"I think it was the whole day moving within an exciting 40 pips range... Anyway it worked out well too. My thoughts on both today's trades:","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#169","p":7,"im":["f0693ebec77449abf04f2ac427a3e101f9080488","0a6887017c3a